--- DATA INPUT ---
- SESSION_LIST: {SESSION_LIST} (Each object must contain session_id, chapter_title, session_topic, teaching_methods)
- CLO_LIST: {CLO_LIST}
- CURRENT_MAPPING: {CURRENT_MAPPING}

--- STRICT CONSTRAINT RULES (100% ENFORCED) ---
1. 'is_all_clos_mapped' must be true IF AND ONLY IF 100% of CLOs are present in CURRENT_MAPPING.
2. 'is_all_sessions_mapped' must be true IF AND ONLY IF 100% of Sessions are present in CURRENT_MAPPING.
3. 'is_valid' MUST BE true IF AND ONLY IF: 'is_all_clos_mapped' is true AND 'is_all_sessions_mapped' is true AND ALL items in the 'data' array have a confidence_score >= 0.8 (no logical mapping errors).
